# `.claude/settings.json` is tracked on purpose — the agent guardrails belong
# with the repository rather than in one developer's global config — but
# setuptools-scm's file finder takes its list from git, so being tracked is
# exactly what swept it into the sdist. It is developer tooling, of no use to
# anyone installing this, and the sdist is what conda-forge builds from.
prune .claude
